@startuml
title watch PATH — algorithm
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Read command and validate arguments;
if (Command syntax valid?) then (yes)
:Validate path syntax without requiring its value to exist;
:Add path once, retain across navigation and edits;
:Display remaining watches with values or unavailable markers;
else (no)
:Display command error, keep current state;
endif
stop
@enduml
